# Keep the build context small and reproducible. Anything generated, secret,
# or host-specific stays out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.git
.git
.github
**/.vercel
vercel.json

# Env / secrets — never bake these in (build args + runtime env instead)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local + editor noise
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
notes
TODO.md
*.md
!README.md
